; The richest table in the game, and the point is that it is the *lesser* of the two things killing
; it gets you — the hoard's tome is the real prize, and the conversation gets you that without any of
; this. Somebody who kills an Ancient for its scales has made a bad trade and the numbers should let
; them find that out.
